WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
You take two tools that are each good on their own, and you combine them,

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.200
and you get a much stronger response than from either one alone.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.600
Listen, I'll give you an example. These electromagnets you work with:

4
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:17.500
nobody ever put this much metal on my body the way you do.

5
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
It's always these little ones that barely do anything.

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Here you bring the full power of this electromagnet. It must really be doing its job.

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.600
Yes, it works very well on tissue renewal.

8
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.100
It helps the body recover, it helps the body

9
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.800
balance itself a little.

10
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.000
Either way, even after the series of treatments I had, I'll keep

11
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.200
coming here at least once a month,

12
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.600
because I think it's important to maintain it.

13
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:52.000
Listen, at my age I want to hear about maintaining what I have.

14
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.700
Come on, in January I turn 80. I'm not some kid of 40 or 50.

15
00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.400
I'm 80,

16
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.100
people my age walk with a cane, and I'm still running on the pitch.

17
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:08.600
We want to see you running on the pitch after 100 too. You make a lot of sense.

18
00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.400
When in January?

19
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.100
The first of January.

20
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:18.600
I was born on the first of the first, at one o'clock: 1-1-1.

21
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.000
Great. What year? '43. Wow.

22
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:28.700
The first of January, '43. So now, on January 1st, I turn 80. Wow. Okay, guys.

23
00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:32.300
Thank you very much, we're very happy.

24
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:33.600
Be well. Thank you too.
